sentences.text:
In the result, this revision petition is allowed as follows;
The conviction and sentence of the revision petitioners/accused Nos.1 and 2 under Rule 32(e),(f) &
(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Rules, 1955 r/w Section 16(1)(a)(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 in ST No.290 of 2009 by Judicial First Class Magistrate Court -I, Vaikom and as upheld in Crl.Appl.No.47 of 2013 by the Sessions Court, Kottayam are set aside and the revision petitioners/accused Nos.1 and 2 are set at liberty.

